abstract: >
  SLATE extends Native Sparse Attention (NSA) with three mathematical
  innovations to provide provable training stability: a spectrally-
  constrained compression operator with information-monotonicity
  guarantee, Fisher-information weighted token selection, and a
  Lyapunov-derived annealing schedule with bifurcation guard. The
  spectral constraint and combined system are fully validated at toy
  scale. UK Patent Application GB2612127.7.
